-- Drive corpus import, batch 1 (Chat 4 autonomous pass, 2026-08-15).
-- Source: founder's Google Drive ORYN data corpus (UAA school counselor documents,
-- cross-checked against official institution/provider pages by a prior verification pass
-- on 2026-08-15 — see scripts/drive-import/README.md for the full corpus inventory and
-- methodology, and scripts/drive-import/{parse,generate_sql}.py for the reusable pipeline
-- that generated this exact file (also documented in docs/data-readiness.md).
-- Every row below already passed that pass's 'Verified' identity gate; rows the corpus
-- itself marked Review/Rejected are excluded, not silently included.
--
-- This session has no working SUPABASE_SECRET_KEY (see .env.local), so this file was
-- never applied to the live database — apply it by hand via the Supabase SQL editor,
-- or run it through the CLI once the key is available. Idempotent: safe to re-run.

-- ===== Universities: 31 new (of 50 in the Drive corpus; the rest already
-- exist from the prior pass's seed.sql — matched here by (lower(name), country) so this
-- insert is a strict superset addition, never a duplicate). =====
