  ('Tilburg University', 'Netherlands', 'Data Science', 'english_proficiency', 'Data Science — English language requirement', '* English language proficiency requirements: for our English-taught Bachelor''s programs you need prove that your level of English is sufficient. | Please note: the test results cannot be older than two years prior to the start of the academic year and you need to have proof of English proficiency at the time of application.', 'https://www.tilburguniversity.edu/education/bachelors-programs/application-and-admission'),
