values
  ('67th London International Youth Science Forum (LIYSF) - 2026', '67th London International Youth Science Forum (LIYSF) - 2026 | https://www.liysf.org.uk/liysf/experience-liysf | https://www.liysf.org.uk/liysf-participation/booking-forms | LIYSF ON-CAMPUS | 23rd July – 6th August 2025 | 15-day STEM programme between July- August 2024 based at Imperial College London for students aged 16-21 | World leading scientists give 12 main lecture demonstrations. | 10 specialist lecture sessions, across subjects such as; Artificial Intelligence, Nano-technology, Engineering, Robotics, Biology, Medicine, Chemistry, Physics, Maths and Astrophysics (choice from a range of topics) | 4 day visits to the best UK university laboratories (London, Oxford, Cambridge and UK), research centres and scientific institutions (choice from range of visits) | 500 students attend from over 70 countries worldwide | Active social programme to share and learn about different cultures…', 'summer_program', 'https://www.liysf.org.uk/liysf/experience-liysf', 'Founder school-counselor Drive corpus, cross-checked against official/provider pages 2026-08-15', 'https://www.liysf.org.uk/liysf/experience-liysf', 'medium', 'active', timestamptz '2026-08-15', '67th london international youth science forum liysf 2026'),
