  ('Brown University (RI, USA)', 'Brown University (RI, USA) | https://precollege.brown.edu/programs | Explore our programs for high school students, you can choose to study on campus, online or at a variety of unique domestic and international locations: | Biological & Natural Sciences, Business Economics & Legal Studies, Engineering & Technology, Language in Context, Medical & Health Sciences, Physical Sciences & Math, Literature Writing & Communications, Political Science Philosophy & History, Psychology & Social Sciences, Visual Creative & Performing Arts | Summer @ Brown | https://precollege.brown.edu/programs/summerbrown | Eligibility for Summer @ Brown: Students completing grades 9 to 12, ages 14 to 18 by June 16, 2024. | Choose from over 300 courses in multiple 1-, 2-, 3- and 4-week on-campus and 5 week hybrid (2 weeks online and 3 weeks on campus) sessions. | Dates: Sunday, June 23 to Friday, July 26, 2024 | BR…', 'summer_program', 'https://precollege.brown.edu/programs', 'Founder school-counselor Drive corpus, cross-checked against official/provider pages 2026-08-15', 'https://precollege.brown.edu/programs', 'high', 'under_review', timestamptz '2026-08-15', 'brown university ri usa'),
