  ('Clark Scholars Program', 'Clark Scholars Program | Texas Tech University | http://www.depts.ttu.edu/honors/academicsandenrichment/affiliatedandhighschool/clarks/ | The Clark Scholar Program is an intensive seven week summer research program for 12 highly qualified high school juniors and seniors. Research opportunities in numerous disciplines: Biology, Cell and Molecular Biology, Chemistry & Biochemistry, Computer Science, Economics/Business/Finance/Marketing, Electrical Engineering & Computer Engineering, History, Microbiology, Physics The Program includes social activities and weekly seminars. Upon completion of a successful research project report, the Scholar will receive a $750 tax-free stipend. 2024 Summer Program Dates: June 16, 2024 - August 1, 2024 | 19.0 | Three teacher recommendations Transcript (optional) Test scores (SAT etc.) Extracurriculars | Applicants must be at least 17 years of age by the pro…', 'summer_program', 'https://www.depts.ttu.edu/clarkscholars/ApplicationDetails.php', 'Founder school-counselor Drive corpus, cross-checked against official/provider pages 2026-08-15', 'https://www.depts.ttu.edu/clarkscholars/ApplicationDetails.php', 'medium', 'active', timestamptz '2026-08-15', 'clark scholars program'),
  ('College Edge Summer', 'College Edge Summer: | https://precollege.sps.columbia.edu/programs/summer-programs/college-edge-summer?utm_campaign=PREC-GC_SU25_DL07&utm_content=Precollege&utm_medium=Internal&utm_source=Email&utm_term=SHGEN5 | In the College Edge program, students in grades 11–12 truly get the college experience by earning college credit as they learn alongside Columbia’s undergrad students on our Morningside campus. Students will also receive academic advisement and professional development opportunities. | Summer Session A: May 26–July 3, 2025 | Summer Session B: July 7–August 15, 2025 | General Application Deadline: April 2, 2025 | Program Contact email: hsp@columbia.edu', 'summer_program', 'https://precollege.sps.columbia.edu/programs/summer-programs/college-edge-summer', 'Founder school-counselor Drive corpus, cross-checked against official/provider pages 2026-08-15', 'https://precollege.sps.columbia.edu/programs/summer-programs/college-edge-summer', 'high', 'under_review', timestamptz '2026-08-15', 'college edge summer'),
